shot\n<sks> left side view high-angle shot wide shot\n<sks> front-left quarter view high-angle shot wide shot"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "title": "提示词模板", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [588.2000122070312, 410.29998779296875], "pos": [-2356.48828125, -1000.8478393554688], "id": 125, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["使用方法：\n\n一、 核心使用规则触发词（Trigger Word）：\n 必须在提示词开头使用 <sks>。指令结构： <sks> [方位角指令] [仰角指令] [距离指令]。\n推荐权重： 0.8 到 1.0（在 ComfyUI 中建议先从 1.0 开始测试）。\n训练基础： 该模型基于 3,000 多张由高斯泼溅（Gaussian Splatting）渲染生成的图像训练，具有极强的 3D 空间逻辑。\n\n二、 96 个视角指令拆解视角由以下三个维度的参数排列组合而成（8 X 4 X 3 = 96）：\n1. 方位角（Azimuth）- 决定环绕角度（共 8 个）控制相机围绕人物水平旋转的位置：\nfront view (0°)\nfront-right view (45°)\nright view (90°)\nback-right view (135°)\nback view (180°)\nback-left view (225°)\nleft view (270°)\nfront-left view (315°)\n\n2. 仰角（Elevation）- 决定垂直高度（共 4 个）控制相机的高低透视：\n\nlow-angle shot (-30°)：极具冲击力的底角度仰拍。\neye-level shot (0°)：平视视角。\nhigh-angle shot (30°)：常规俯拍。\nbird's-eye view (60°)：上帝视角/深俯拍。\n\n3. 距离（Distance）- 决定景别（共 3 个）控制相机的远近：\n\nclose-up shot：特写。\nmedium shot：中景。\nwide shot：全景/远景。\n\n三、 实战示例（如何拼写提示词）你可以直接在 Qwen-Edit 的提示词框中组合上述指令：\n极致张力打斗（仰拍全景）：<sks> low-angle shot wide shot front view \n侧后方追逐特写（俯拍）：<sks> high-angle shot close-up shot back-right view \n标准角色展示（平视）：<sks> eye-level shot medium shot front view "], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "title": "视角切换用法", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [588.2000122070312, 410.29998779296875], "pos": [-2980.239013671875, -1009.7844848632812], "id": 124, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 7}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "workflowRendererVersion": "LG", "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.35.9", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "groupNodes": {}, "ds": {"offset": [5146.835100394528, 2575.759228121735], "scale": 0.279414